## Original Content
<p>　　新华社莫斯科6月4日电（记者赵冰）俄罗斯外交部长拉夫罗夫4日表示，乌克兰拒绝俄罗斯停火2至3天的提议是“严重错误”。</p> <p>　　俄总统普京当天召集政府成员开会并听取有关俄乌谈判情况的汇报。拉夫罗夫在会上说，俄方提出该建议，是为让双方能够妥善收集接触线上阵亡人员的遗体，或是转移可能存在的伤员。</p> <p>　　普京表示，乌方拒绝俄方上述提议并不令人意外。</p> <p>　　拉夫罗夫还说，在任何情况下，保持沟通渠道总是好的，因为“这使我们能够首先解决人道主义问题”。他表示，相互协调人道主义措施可以释放善意，加强信任，这正是现阶段所必需的。</p>

## Summary
Russian Foreign Minister Lavrov criticized Ukraine for rejecting a 2-3 day ceasefire proposal intended for humanitarian tasks such as collecting fallen soldiers and aiding wounded. President Putin commented that Ukraine's rejection was not surprising and highlighted the importance of communication channels for addressing humanitarian issues and building trust.

## Key Points
- Russia proposed a 2-3 day ceasefire to facilitate humanitarian operations like retrieving bodies and aiding wounded individuals.
- Ukraine rejected the proposal, which Lavrov described as a 'serious mistake'.
- Putin stated that Ukraine's rejection was not unexpected.
- Maintaining communication channels is emphasized as essential for solving humanitarian problems and enhancing trust.
- The ceasefire proposal aimed to release goodwill and strengthen trust at this stage of the conflict.


